uk-margin-remove-first-child\">            \n\n    <img class=\"el-image\" alt data-src=\"/templates/yootheme/cache/photo_2022-10-14_20-10-51-9af8ec22.jpeg\" data-srcset=\"/templates/yootheme/cache/photo_2022-10-14_20-10-51-054f82b7.jpeg 768w, /templates/yootheme/cache/photo_2022-10-14_20-10-51-9af8ec22.jpeg 960w\" data-sizes=\"(min-width: 960px) 960px\" data-width=\"960\" data-height=\"1280\" uk-img>    <div class=\"el-content uk-panel uk-margin-top\"><p>Кроме того, у нас есть бородатая агама Аркадий</p></div>        \n        </div>        \n    </div>\n        <div class=\"el-item\">\n\n        <a class=\"el-title uk-accordion-title\" href=\"#\">Шлёпа</a>\n\n        <div class=\"uk-accordion-content uk-margin-remove-first-child\">            \n\n    <img class=\"el-image\" alt data-src=\"/templates/yootheme/cache/photo_2022-10-14_20-11-05-82d0c0c1.jpeg\" data-srcset=\"/templates/yootheme/cache/photo_2022-10-14_20-11-05-83b9d12b.jpeg 768w, /templates/yootheme/cache/photo_2022-10-14_20-11-05-e43cd676.jpeg 1024w, /templates/yootheme/cache/photo_2022-10-14_20-11-05-cc425277.jpeg 1279w, /templates/yootheme/cache/photo_2022-10-14_20-11-05-82d0c0c1.jpeg 1280w\" data-sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 1280px\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"960\" uk-img>    <div class=\"el-content uk-panel uk-margin-top\"><p>И еще живет кошка Шлёпа</p></div>        \n        </div>        \n    </div>\n    \n</div>\n<h3 uk-scrollspy-class>        <div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ff00ff;\">КОЛЛЕГИ, САЙТ \"ЭРМИТА\" тестировать не нужно, на нем нужно учиться&nbsp;<em>↓</em><em>↓</em><em>↓</em>&nbsp;</span></div>    </h3>\n<div class=\"uk-margin\" uk-scrollspy-class>\n        <a class=\"el-link\" href=\"https://ermita.one/courses/\"><img class=\"el-image\" alt data-src=\"/templates/yootheme/cache/ermita21-632679f3.png\" data-srcset=\"/templates/yootheme/cache/ermita21-52bd009c.png 768w, /templates/yootheme/cache/ermita21-632679f3.png 900w\" data-sizes=\"(min-wi